miniDeepSeek includes code refactored from third-party projects. The original
copyright headers are retained in the derived files, and the project does not
import those repositories at runtime.

- torchtitan (BSD-3-Clause), Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.
  The DeepSeek-V4 model math and parameter layout in
  src/minideepseek/model/{config,nn,rope,mhc,moe,compressor,attention,model}.py
  are refactored from torchtitan/models/deepseek_v4 and models/common.
  See doc/sources.md for the file-by-file mapping.

- MiniMind (Apache-2.0): tokenizer/tokenizer.json and
  tokenizer/tokenizer_config.json are copied unmodified. See doc/sources.md.

- verl (Apache-2.0) and vLLM (Apache-2.0) are referenced only for interface
  design (rollout, OPD, custom reward, Hydra config). No source files are
  copied; they remain optional dependencies. See doc/sources.md and
  doc/decisions.md.
